OL,3,GNEWSANeighbourhood loses deliveries
OL,4,Aafter postie threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of households have had their
OL,7,Fpost suspended after threats were made
OL,8,Ftowards a postie, Royal Mail has said.
OL,10,FThe company said one of its postal
OL,11,Fworkers was "threatened and prevented
OL,12,Ffrom leaving" after attempting to
OL,13,Fdeliver to an address in Sherburn Hill,
OL,14,FCounty Durham, on Thursday.
OL,16,FThis led to the "extraordinary"
OL,17,Fdecision to immediately suspend
OL,18,Fservices to 53 homes in the area to
OL,19,F"safeguard" its employees, it said in a
OL,20,Fletter to those affected. A
OL,21,Fspokesperson said Durham Police was
OL,22,Falso called to the scene.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
