OL,3,GNEWSANeighbourhood loses deliveries
OL,4,Aafter postie threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoyal Mail said it hoped to resume
OL,7,Fpostal services "as soon as it was safe
OL,8,Fto do so". In the meantime, people have
OL,9,Fbeen told they can collect their post
OL,10,Ffrom a nearby delivery office.
